pha remains dispatch_allocated true and dispatched true. That's fine. It also needs candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha (we will have allocated before dispatch). So we need to allocate dispatch slot to shift_candidate_alpha before we dispatch it. So we need to allocate dispatch slot to shift_candidate_alpha, then dispatch it (making vehicle_unit_gamma available). Then we can allocate vehicle_unit_gamma to shift_candidate_beta, prepare beta, stage beta, allocate dispatch slot for beta? Wait goal does not require dispatch_allocated or dispatched for shift_candidate_beta. Actually goal does not include dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_beta, dispatch_ready shift_candidate_beta, dispatched shift_candidate_beta. So we don't need to dispatch shift_candidate_beta. Good.)
